proposed stage.\n- Capture independent QA and Root evidence for all four features. Final counted scope is **5,203 / 7,020 lines** (5,195 captured features + 8 for the CI checkout repair); installed **v1.5.0** remains pinned and verified.\n- Fetch full Git history in the fixture CI job so pinned historical evidence and release tags are available. Actual shallow/full-clone replay and independent review verify the fix.\n- Preserve failed attempts and record the operator-authorized recovery. A separately reviewed, hash-pinned closeout adapter corrects a five-column debt-table checker defect; original failures remain recorded. Resolve NDEBT-054 only after actual capture.\n\n## Related feature / phase\n\n- Phase: `017-workflow-assurance-foundation`\n- Features: `115`, `116`, `117`, `118`\n- Contracts: `.agent/contracts/115.json` through `.agent/contracts/118.json`\n- Final capture: `.agent/evidence/118/evidence-capture.json`\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- [x] Feature 118: independent current 20-case prerequisite at immutable SourceC2; Generator and independent Mode B each ran the three exact required checks.\n- [x] Fresh QA: foundation readiness, repository compliance (16/16), payload compliance (12/12), and an independently designed symlinked-proof attack with valid/restored controls.\n- [x] Root: verified all 24 prerequisite/QA proof hashes, source/runtime/historical identities, independent actors and captured receipts; corrected terminal scope and installed 238-file payload plus provenance passed.\n- [x] Governed documentation version/change-log pairing and completed-feature contract/QA/evidence chain passed.\n- [x] Integrated PR CI: compliance, bootstrap, fixtures, convergent-review tests, self-governance and release closeout all passed on `0b9e1b1bc4a8bbdd5b67885b3587840fd033a99a` (compliance run 38521690175; closeout run 38521690204).\n\n## Reviewer notes\n\nInitial CI exposed the fixture job's shallow checkout assumption. The original failure and corrected replay are retained under `.agent/evidence/118/integration-ci-*`; earlier feature captures remain unchanged. Integrated local checks are recorded in `integration-local-f84-*`.\n\nMerge with a **merge commit** to retain immutable test/source commits and evidence ancestry. The operator explicitly authorized PR management and clean merges; no release tag or installed upgrade is part of this PR.\n\nThe recorded closeout exception is `.agent/evidence/118/recovery1-closeout-override.json`; independent review is `recovery1-closeout-review.json`. The unchanged terminal checker fails at the documented debt Notes comparison; the corrected checker passes all remaining original scope checks. This is disclosed as an override, not an original-check pass. Actual command receipts use the approved producer's unique COMMAND/REVISION/EXIT headers and preserved stdout/stderr.\n\nHistorical scope receipts describe their exercised snapshots. Current main documentation was integrated after capture; previous scope proofs are not reinterpreted as whole-tree approvals of later main changes.\n\n## Post-merge verification\n\nMerged as `e619d284d36eaf6dfff54a9d001477b8d1722098`. All five compliance jobs passed on the actual main merge commit: [main CI run 38521902261](https://github.com/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/actions/runs/38521902261). Phase 017 is complete; phase 016 controller core remains proposed.\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T06:12:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T06:25:34Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T06:23:09Z","merged_at":"2026-10-14T06:23:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"e619d284d36eaf6dfff54a9d001477b8d1722098","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/pulls/94/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/pulls/94/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niq-cnr/nizam-framework/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.g